Full rules: [docs/engineering/testing.md](../../docs/engineering/testing.md).

Key points when writing or editing a test in this repo:

- Unit/component tests only — no E2E, no Detox/Maestro/Playwright.
- `@testing-library/react-native`'s `render()` is **async** in the installed
  version — always `await render(...)`, and destructure the query helpers
  from the resolved result rather than using the global `screen` singleton.
- Test behavior (what renders, what a pure function returns, what happens on
  interaction), not implementation details or static styling.
- Tests live next to the code they test (`Thing.tsx` → `Thing.test.tsx`).
- See `src/shared/components/ui.test.tsx` for the reference pattern.
